From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jrash <johnrash@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 11:41:58 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 09/17] luks2 tests: loader_console.py reads the rest of the
 line it waited for

With --until it stopped reading as soon as the text showed up, so the
rest of the line (the boot partition's path) could be missing from the
log and run-loader-disk-test.sh failed a boot that was right.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/tests/system/luks2/qemu/loader_console.py | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/tests/system/luks2/qemu/loader_console.py b/src/tests/system/luks2/qemu/loader_console.py
index ddead9dc12..7160de47e7 100755
--- a/src/tests/system/luks2/qemu/loader_console.py
+++ b/src/tests/system/luks2/qemu/loader_console.py
@@ -78,9 +78,10 @@ while time.time() - start < timeout:
             state = "wait"
     elif state == "wait" and now > done_at:
         break
-    if until is not None and until in seen:
-        time.sleep(2)
-        break
+    if until is not None and done_at is None and until in seen:
+        # keep reading a moment: the rest of the line is still coming
+        done_at = now + 2
+        state = "wait"
 
 log.close()
 print("console: done after %d s" % (time.time() - start), flush=True)
